  "hotelOpportunityThesis": "YOTEL Geneva Lake (Founex, Vaud) offers 237 rooms and six flexible meeting spaces (up to about 250 delegates) with hybrid facilities and an airport shuttle. Secondary accommodation block or small ancillary meeting only — the main congress is committed to CICG in central Geneva and historic official hotels are city-centre. Founex needs a dedicated transfer plan; do not present as an easy congress base. Inference: airport-corridor accommodation plus six meeting spaces and hybrid facilities suit selected groups, subject to Founex-to-CICG transfer acceptance.",
